          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Standard error $=\\sigma/\\sqrt{n}=36/\\sqrt{100}=3.6$. Then $z=(75-87)/3.6=-3.33$, so $P(\\bar X>75)=1-P(Z<-3.33)=1-0\\approx 1.00$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Sai số chuẩn $=\\sigma/\\sqrt{n}=36/\\sqrt{100}=3.6$. Khi đó $z=(75-87)/3.6=-3.33$, nên $P(\\bar X>75)=1-P(Z<-3.33)=1-0\\approx 1.00$.</p></div>"
